{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grandpa said, \u201cDig\u201d \u2014 and vanished.<br>The bank said, \u201cPay\u201d \u2014 and didn\u2019t.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve inherited not gold, but debt \u2014 growing every minute. The only way out is to drill deeper, mine faster, and pay before the interest eats you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your drill into a real beast, blast through rock with dynamite, and reach the heart of the earth \u2014 where, maybe, the truth about your grandpa\u2019s disappearance and your cursed inheritance awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd29 <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive mine</strong> \u2014 every meter down brings new resources, dangers, and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing debt</strong> \u2014 \u201cInterest doesn\u2019t speak, it shows.\u201d \u00a9 The Banker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drill upgrades</strong> \u2014 boost power, add modules, unlock crazy enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamite!</strong> \u2014 when the drill fails, explosions prevail. Big booms are never a bad idea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art &amp; 2D gameplay</strong> \u2014 cozy retro vibes with a pinch of despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious story</strong> \u2014 where the greed of the bank meets the madness of grandpa\u2019s experiments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drill Baby Drill</strong> \u2014 a pixel drilling simulator about upgrades and eternal debt.<br>Dig deeper. Boom louder. Pay faster.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066410?t=1761681450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066410/eb40934b742c2b9279093df273af3a119b98cdb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1